  "notes": "### Added\n- Money entries can be linked to a savings, investment or bank account. Filter entries by account and see each account's activity this month; Update value suggests the latest value plus linked activity.\n- Delete an account right from its row in Savings and investments.\n- Change a task's parent or area after creating it; subtasks and descriptions move with it. Also in the CLI (`pyxida task move`) and for agents.\n- Edit Google Calendar events from Pyxida (for repeating events, only the one you picked).\n- Automatic backups: a weekly or daily zip of your workspace in a folder you choose, keeping the last few. Back up now from Settings.\n- Sync setup guide in three steps: choose a passphrase, save your recovery key safely, and confirm it.\n- Open folder in Settings, and Show file for a recovery key left in the Pyxida folder.\n\n### Changed\n- New tasks start in the last area you used, always at the top level.\n- Money remembers All, Personal or Business until you change it.\n- Needs attention in Sync now says what is wrong, with a button to fix it.\n- Tab in the note editor indents the line instead of leaving the editor.\n\n### Fixed\n- The Change passphrase window now uses one column.",
